# Regras R8 / ProGuard do Unme para WebRTC (JNI) e Socket.IO

-keep class org.webrtc.** { *; }
-dontwarn org.webrtc.**

-keep class io.socket.** { *; }
-dontwarn io.socket.**
-dontwarn okhttp3.**
-dontwarn okio.**

-keepclassmembers class com.example.unme.** {
    @android.webkit.JavascriptInterface <methods>;
}
